b-count aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n      <button class=\"hub-clear\" type=\"button\" data-hub-clear hidden>Limpar filtros</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hub-list\" data-hub-list>\n<!-- SEO:HUB-FALLBACK:START --><!-- SEO:HUB-FALLBACK:END -->\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ══ TESTIMONIALS (hidden until real quotes exist) ══════════════════════ -->\n<section class=\"section\" data-hub-testimonials-sec hidden>\n<div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"hub-sec-head\">\n    <h2 class=\"hub-sec-h\">Da comunidade de vendedores</h2>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"hub-quotes\" data-hub-testimonials></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ══ CTA ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->\n<section class=\"section\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"hub-cta\">\n    <div>\n      <h2>Pronto para colocar esses insights em pr&aacute;tica?</h2>\n      <p>Entre na lista de espera e seja um dos primeiros a entrar quando abrirmos o seu marketplace.</p>\n    </div>\n    <a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" href=\"index.html#waitlist\">Entre na lista de espera</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n</main>",
